{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Hunt Grounds",
    "steam_appid": 2472820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/67a6107f77f0d00beacf495f85c47356.poster.avif?t=1754945895\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/67a6107f77f0d00beacf495f85c47356.webm?t=1754945895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/67a6107f77f0d00beacf495f85c47356.mp4?t=1754945895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br><br>Welcome to Hunt Grounds</strong>, a multiplayer horror survival experience where players must navigate the terrifying Hunt Grounds, an abandoned and dangerous location where hunters and survivors face off in a deadly game of cat and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>survivor</strong>, your mission is simple: stay alive. Scavenge for essential supplies, unlock hidden escape routes, and use powerful supernatural items to turn the tide in your favor. Whether you choose to team up with others or go alone, you\u2019ll need to stay sharp as the hunters relentlessly track your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>hunter</strong>, the thrill of the hunt is your calling. Use your heightened senses to track down survivors, unleash your unique abilities to corner your prey, and eliminate anyone who stands in your way. Each hunter has their own terrifying powers, ensuring that no two hunts are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/d1af7031002a8d8f41da6966f93981dd.poster.avif?t=1754945895\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/d1af7031002a8d8f41da6966f93981dd.webm?t=1754945895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/d1af7031002a8d8f41da6966f93981dd.mp4?t=1754945895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Multiplayer Matches</strong>: Face off in thrilling 1 vs 4 asymmetrical gameplay, where the hunter must stop survivors from escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural Crafting</strong>: Survivors can gather materials and craft chaos relics to teleport, rewind time, vanish from sight etc..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Playstyles</strong>: Choose from a variety of hunters and survivors, each with unique skills and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Maps</strong>: Navigate eerie, atmospheric environments full of danger and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer outwitting your opponents as a cunning survivor or dominating the hunt as a fearsome predator, <strong>Hunt Grounds</strong> offers an intense, high-stakes multiplayer experience where survival is everything.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/67a6107f77f0d00beacf495f85c47356.poster.avif?t=1754945895\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/67a6107f77f0d00beacf495f85c47356.webm?t=1754945895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/67a6107f77f0d00beacf495f85c47356.mp4?t=1754945895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br><br>Welcome to Hunt Grounds</strong>, a multiplayer horror survival experience where players must navigate the terrifying Hunt Grounds, an abandoned and dangerous location where hunters and survivors face off in a deadly game of cat and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>survivor</strong>, your mission is simple: stay alive. Scavenge for essential supplies, unlock hidden escape routes, and use powerful supernatural items to turn the tide in your favor. Whether you choose to team up with others or go alone, you\u2019ll need to stay sharp as the hunters relentlessly track your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>hunter</strong>, the thrill of the hunt is your calling. Use your heightened senses to track down survivors, unleash your unique abilities to corner your prey, and eliminate anyone who stands in your way. Each hunter has their own terrifying powers, ensuring that no two hunts are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/d1af7031002a8d8f41da6966f93981dd.poster.avif?t=1754945895\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/d1af7031002a8d8f41da6966f93981dd.webm?t=1754945895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472820/extras/d1af7031002a8d8f41da6966f93981dd.mp4?t=1754945895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Multiplayer Matches</strong>: Face off in thrilling 1 vs 4 asymmetrical gameplay, where the hunter must stop survivors from escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural Crafting</strong>: Survivors can gather materials and craft chaos relics to teleport, rewind time, vanish from sight etc..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Playstyles</strong>: Choose from a variety of hunters and survivors, each with unique skills and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Maps</strong>: Navigate eerie, atmospheric environments full of danger and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer outwitting your opponents as a cunning survivor or dominating the hunt as a fearsome predator, <strong>Hunt Grounds</strong> offers an intense, high-stakes multiplayer experience where survival is everything.</p>",
    "short_description": "Step into Hunt Grounds, an asymmetric horror game where you scavenge for ordinary items and enchant them with supernatural powers to create chaos and turn the tide against a relentless hunter.",
